## Architecture

- Outpost-Core: business logic library
	- Event sourcing / CQRS
- Outpost-Server: Actix-Web, REST API, Tera templates
	- sqlite database
	- (possible) Redis K/V store
	- HTMX + Alpine.js + Typescript + other JS/TS libraries
	- (future) WASM - for what? plugins? native client on web?
- Outpost-Client: Rust client static library + python package wrapper
- Outpost-Desktop (future): Native desktop client

